# UI tests

Follow `.cursor/skills/ui-testing/SKILL.md`.

Find elements with `getByRole` / `getByLabelText` / `getByText`. Interact with
`userEvent`. Do not use `querySelector`, `getByTestId`, or `.focus()` to drive
the test.
